{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43288","headline":"鲛人潜织 · 康翊仁","name":"鲛人潜织","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"珠馆冯夷室，灵鲛信所潜。\n幽闲云碧牖，滉瀁水精帘。\n机动龙梭跃，丝萦藕淬添。\n七襄牛女恨，三日大人嫌。\n透手击吴练，凝冰笑越缣。\n无因听札札，空想濯纤纤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"康翊仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43288.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43288","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}